{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達最先進的AI伺服器硬件近日被發現出現在上海一處數據中心，相關記錄指向一名正深陷美國晶片走私爭議的商界女性。<strong>提交給中國監管機構的貸款文件顯示，「長三角」（Yangtze River Delta Project）項目以一台GB300 NVL72機架和一台GB200伺服器作為抵押品，而該項目與新加坡雲計算公司Megaspeed的創始人黃樂有關。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588260.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T18:04:19.748865+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T17:37:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T17:57:32.511585+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T17:57:32.511585+00:00","content_hash":"d2143311827dc8b17f14ab3910909f33ed848c5eac53848350586a091be0fdf1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}